# The gpux sentence on a machine with no device, Windows 2026-11-28.
#
# The typo run of 2026-11-27 asserted the sentence on a Device label that named the
# RTX 3060. Whether the same sentence reaches the label when no device answers was
# inferred, so the same --label-contains assertion was run against the two builds
# that have no device to name:
#
#   A. -DOFXPLUGIN_VULKAN=OFF: no device code compiled in at all.
#   B. the device path compiled in, on a loader that finds no driver - every ICD
#      hidden by pointing VK_DRIVER_FILES/VK_ICD_FILENAMES at a file that does not
#      exist, which is the state a machine without a Vulkan install is in.
#
# Each block is the lines that decide the claim; the full logs stay in .validation/.
# The runner's own step 6 asserted device=Vulkan on both of them and failed there,
# after the self-test had passed on the CPU loop - that is the fix that came with
# this run, and why A ended with "all Windows checks passed" instead of a failure.

